{"action":"opened","issue":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vega/vega-lite/issues/3250","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vega/vega-lite","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vega/vega-lite/issues/3250/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vega/vega-lite/issues/3250/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vega/vega-lite/issues/3250/events","html_url":"https://github.com/vega/vega-lite/issues/3250","id":285301741,"number":3250,"title":"Not able to create an autosize object in config","user":{"login":"jwoLondon","id":1846999,"avatar_url":"https://avatars2.githubusercontent.com/u/1846999?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jwoLondon","html_url":"https://github.com/jwoLondon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jwoLondon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jwoLondon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jwoLondon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jwoLondon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jwoLondon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jwoLondon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jwoLondon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jwoLondon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jwoLondon/received_events","type":"User","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2018-01-01T11:10:28Z","updated_at":"2018-01-01T11:10:28Z","closed_at":null,"author_association":"NONE","body":"Perhaps I'm missing something, but if I try to create an `autosize` object in `config`, Vega-Lite reports the fatal error `TypeError: Attempted to assign to readonly property.`. The documentation implies that `config` use `autosize` with an object parameter. This becomes a problem when wishing to set some of the other autosize parameters that require an object (`resize` and `contains`)

This is valid:

    "config": {"autosize":"fit"}

But this generates the error:

    "config": {"autosize": {"type":"fit"}}

Setting the same as a top level property rather than via `config` works fine:

    "autosize":{"type":"fit"}

"}}

