{"action":"created","issue":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KonektOU/estonian-banklinks-for-woocommerce/issues/17","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KonektOU/estonian-banklinks-for-woocommerce","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KonektOU/estonian-banklinks-for-woocommerce/issues/17/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KonektOU/estonian-banklinks-for-woocommerce/issues/17/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KonektOU/estonian-banklinks-for-woocommerce/issues/17/events","html_url":"https://github.com/KonektOU/estonian-banklinks-for-woocommerce/issues/17","id":285253689,"number":17,"title":"Maksekeskus return_url is not updated when wordpress home url is changed","user":{"login":"martinl","id":148686,"avatar_url":"https://avatars3.githubusercontent.com/u/148686?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/martinl","html_url":"https://github.com/martinl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martinl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martinl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martinl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martinl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martinl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martinl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martinl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martinl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/martinl/received_events","type":"User","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2017-12-31T11:50:40Z","updated_at":"2018-01-01T11:10:36Z","closed_at":null,"author_association":"NONE","body":"Maksekeskus gateway return_url value is stored in Wordpress options table (option_value woocommerce_maksekeskus_redirect_settings) on first plugin install and is not updated when home url is changed in Wordpress settings (eg when switching site from http to https after plugin install). This means that redirects back from Maksekeskus will fail.

Setting return urls in Maksekeskus user portal as workaround does work because the local return_url overrides portal settings. Uninstalling and reinstalling the plugin does not work either since plugin settings are retained after uninstall. Afaik, only way to update the return_url value is directly in the database.

