After adding Google it no more works, adding Microsoft Account I get the same problem.
The Google and MS account selection and auth pages are presented then the OnAuthenticated  code is executed, next the error 500 is generated by owin. The web page location is set to my LogonCallback url but stopped by the 500 error.
What is really strange is that Facebook has been working for months.
I checked all the code and have made no addition which could break the routing system.
Any idea welcome.

